(* README *)

1 - Summary
    -------

    L001 proves a local diagonal obstruction over M001's closed implication and
    falsity syntax.  Its generic acceptance predicate

      C : Formula -> Prop

    has only the properties explicitly supplied to each theorem.

    The proof has two independent inputs:

      diagonal:     B ~=_C not B
      local branch: C B \/ C (not B)

    Modus ponens turns these into `C Bot`; consistency then yields `False`.
    A goal-restricted evaluation premise can produce the diagonal, but no
    universal evaluation frame is part of L001.

    Derived public theorems expose the same argument more precisely.  They
    allow an arbitrary goal `G`, require only the fixed-point direction used
    by the selected branch, isolate the three local detachment instances, and
    show that consistency excludes both sides at a negation fixed point.
    These strengthenings do not add clauses to the six-contract aggregate.


2 - Classification boundary
    -----------------------

    `ClosureSignedClassification C` certifies one of the two internal branches:

      true  -> C A
      false -> C (not A)

    `ClosureMembershipDecision C` instead decides membership in `C`.  Turning
    non-membership into `C (not A)` requires the explicit premise
    `ClosureRefutationComplete C`.

    Negative-only refutation has no condition on a false verdict, so the
    always-false function inhabits it for every `C`.


3 - Files
    -----

    L001_00_Premises.v

      The vocabulary required by the six contracts, including the local
      detachment instance used by the derived collapse theorems.

    L001_01__Aporetic_Lemma.v

      Goal-restricted diagonal production, branchwise and goal-relative
      collapse, and the retained local branch collapse.

    L001_02__Aporetic_Obstruction.v

      Fixed-point gap, local obstruction, signed and membership obstructions,
      and generic refutation inhabitation.

    L001_95_API.v

      The six canonical contracts and their aggregate.

    L001_97_Artifacts.v

      The single certified aggregate `l001_contract_qed` and its assumption
      report.


4 - Public API
    ----------

    Stable import:

      From L001 Require Import L001_95_API.

    Vocabulary:

      ClosureTheory
      ClosureEquiv
      ClosureModusPonens
      ClosureDetachmentAt
      ClosureConsistent
      NegationFixedPointFor
      ClosureNegationFixedPoint
      ClosureLocalExcludedMiddle
      ClosureLocalLEM
      ClosureSignedClassification
      ClosureMembershipDecision
      ClosureRefutationComplete
      ClosureEvaluationFrameForGoal

    Proof endpoints:

      eval_bottom_negfixp
      closure_modus_ponens_detachment_at
      branchwise_goal_relative_collapse
      goal_relative_branch_collapse
      local_branch_collapse
      fixedpoint_gap
      core_diagonal_obstruction
