    Contracts:

      LOCAL_COLLAPSE
      LOCAL_OBSTRUCTION
      NEGATION_DIAGONAL
      SIGNED_OBSTRUCTION
      MEMBERSHIP_OBSTRUCTION
      REFUTATION_INHABITED
      L001_CONTRACT

    Certified endpoint:

      l001_contract_qed


5 - Boundary
    --------

    L001 contains no full-frame compatibility layer, global-LEM wrapper,
    regulator specialization, status branch, Curry-labelled restatement,
    decision/decider alias, or legacy contract surface.  M001 remains the
    syntactic checker substrate.  The derived strengthening endpoints do not
    enlarge `L001_CONTRACT`.  L002 consumes only L001's goal-restricted frame
    and negation-fixed-point vocabulary.
